<title>UK: Schig sets 150 million Swiss franc 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Schig sets 150 million Swiss franc 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager CSFB.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SCHIENEN INFRASTRUKTUR FINANZIERUNGS-GESELLSCHAFT</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  REPUBLIC OF AUSTRIA</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.625     MATURITY    23.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.55    PAY DATE    23.JUL.97</p>
<p>FULL FEES  2.75  </p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 5	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
